  "translation": "Olsem tu asde, olsem bipo tru, taim Seol i stap yet king, yu wanpela i bringautim na bringap ol man bilong ⟨את⟩ Yisrael; na Yahwe Elohim bilong yu i tokim yu olsem: Yu bai lukautim ol sipsip bilong ⟨את⟩ ol man bilong mi, ⟨את⟩ Yisrael, na yu bai kamap bikman bilong ol man bilong mi Yisrael.",
